 "description": "Start registering a 4chems account with a business email address (`email`,\n`name`, optional `company`). Anonymous. Emails a 6-digit code to the address;\nno account exists yet. Ask the user for the code, then call\nverify_account_registration with the returned challenge_id and code. Free-mail\naddresses (gmail.com, ...) are refused: use the company address, or call\nstart_inquiry. The answer is the same whether or not the address already has\nan account.",
 "inputSchema": {
